   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Giving advice with empathy",
     "texto": [
      "The formula **Se fossi in te + conditional** is irreplaceable for advising without sounding bossy: **Se fossi in te, parlerei con il responsabile** (if I were you, I would talk to the manager); **Se fossi in te, chiederei chiarimenti** (if I were you, I would ask for clarification).",
      "It is much more elegant than the direct imperative."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Immediate practical conditions",
     "texto": [
      "With the present indicative: **Se hai fame, c'è della pizza nel frigo** (if you are hungry, there is pizza in the fridge); **Se hai bisogno di aiuto, dimmelo subito** (if you need help, tell me straight away)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
